      "title": "A Queensland man enjoyed soaring profits from a crypto trading app. Then his money started disappearing",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/15/australia-crypto-money-investment-scam-ai-fraud-crime",
      "description": "<p>The administrative work required to run an effective investment scam has been drastically cut by using merging technology</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Within days of clicking on an online ad for a cryptocurrency trading app, a 29-year-old Queensland man watched his dashboard soar with profits.</p><p>Making investment gains was as simple as downloading the slick-looking app and browser extension linked to his crypto wallet. So he invested more.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/15/australia-crypto-money-investment-scam-ai-fraud-crime\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-14T15:00:31"
    },
    {
      "title": "Lending to property investors falls sharply in ‘tiny’ step towards fairer housing market in Australia, expert says",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/14/lending-to-property-investors-falls-sharply-in-tiny-step-towards-fairer-housing-market-in-australia-expert-says",
      "description": "<p>ABS data shows an almost 9% slump in new lending to investors after three interest rate hikes this year</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/14/australia-news-live-kpmg-inquiry-icac-alan-jones-trial-gst-treasurer-jim-chalmers-anthony-albanese-angus-taylor-pauline-hanson-labor-liberals-one-nation-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>In what one economist is describing as a “tiny step” toward a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/07/housing-property-prices-affordability-australia-avoid-major-market-crash\">fairer housing market</a> after decades of bad policy, property investors are shying away from established homes, and putting money into new builds instead, new data shows.</p><p>New lending to property investors fell sharply in the three months to June, slumping almost 9%, ABS data showed, while the number of total new home loans dropped by 5.4% in the June quarter.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/14/lending-to-property-investors-falls-sharply-in-tiny-step-towards-fairer-housing-market-in-australia-expert-says\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-14T08:03:29"
    },
    {
      "title": "Alleged victim says Alan Jones groped him at lunch and describes fear of being seen as broadcaster’s ‘toy’, court hears",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/14/alan-jones-trial-alleged-victim-broadcaster-eggs-soldiers-ironed-underpants-court-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Former 2GB and 2UE radio broadcaster is facing 22 indecent assault and sexual touching charges. Jones, 85, has pleaded not guilty</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/14/australia-news-live-kpmg-inquiry-icac-alan-jones-trial-gst-treasurer-jim-chalmers-anthony-albanese-angus-taylor-pauline-hanson-labor-liberals-one-nation-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A young driver for Alan Jones felt “violated” and “trapped” when the broadcaster allegedly touched him on the penis in the car and kissed him in a lift, but didn’t complain due to the “extraordinary” power dynamic between the pair, a Sydney court has been told.</p><p>Complainant C, now aged in his 40s, on Friday told Jones’s indecent assault trial that interactions between the pair escalated over time.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/14/alan-jones-trial-alleged-victim-broadcaster-eggs-soldiers-ironed-underpants-court-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-14T07:59:06"
    },
